  scale         16   success 0.76   spread 0.218   yes
  scale          2   success 0.09   spread 0.142   no
  scale         32   success 0.98   spread 0.050   yes
  bracketed: width 2 fails, width 16 succeeds

Step 2.  halve the interval
  narrowed to widths 2 to 16

Step 3.  check that success stays above
  width 32: yes
  width 64: yes
  upward closed

